  "category": "scroll-section-layouts",
  "isReactBits": false,
  "description": "Full-screen intro where image cards fly out into a ring, unwind with a rotation, then keep slowly spinning around a blurred-in centered title, with random cards flipping over.",
  "contents": [
    "Ring of image cards",
    "Centered uppercase title lines with a subtitle",
    "Radial gradient background"
  ],
  "behavior": [
    "Cards scale in with a stagger from the center onto a circle",
    "The group unwinds with a power4 rotation while the title fades in from blur",
    "The ring spins continuously",
    "A random card flips on an interval",
    "Radius and card size switch at a breakpoint",
    "Reduced motion shows the final state without animation"
